.TH geectl-remote-owners-for-binary 1  "geectl-remote-owners-for-binary 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-owners\-for\-binary \- Show the owners of a binary package
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote owners\-for\-binary\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBINARY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the owners of a binary package
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show each person as `login (realname <email>)`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBINARY\fR>
The binary package name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
